                "text": "I\u2019m voting NO on this CR.\n\nTrump & House Rs shut down the government, took an 8-week vacation, and came back with a bill that does nothing to fix the health care nightmare they created. 24 million Americans will now pay 2\u20133x more for health insurance. It's disgraceful. https://t.co/iDM1EVm57a",
