                "text": "For 8 weeks, House Republicans took a taxpayer-funded vacation while refusing to fix the health care crisis they created. Now 24 million Americans are seeing premiums skyrocket in cost. Trump & Republicans chose themselves over working families. I voted no. To read my full statement visit: https://t.co/Q9V8r97xMV",
