                "text": "At today\u2019s @HouseBudgetDems hearing with the nonpartisan Congressional Budget Office (CBO), I asked how Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly Law will harm millions of working class families.\n\nAnd they confirmed what Democrats already knew: the law increases the deficit and strips health care from millions.This is a betrayal.",
