                "text": "Our students deserve more mental health support at school. That\u2019s why @RepBrianFitz and I introduced the Increasing Access to Mental Health in Schools Act. As a psychologist & former educator, I will never stop fighting to ensure every student gets the care they need to thrive. https://t.co/JXTP62DuTG",
