                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Trump Admin just ended a federal rule that helped limit a type of air pollution known to cause heart & lung problems. Health experts say this rule could have prevented 1,000's of early deaths every year.\n\nPutting polluters ahead of people is not putting America first.",
